  unitName: Pixy Lord Leore
  unitId: 30155
  unitNumber: 473
  description: A human boy who was raised by Titania as a pixy. He was seen as a
    threat thanks to his ability to bring pixy and human forces together, and a plot
    was formed for his assassination. However, thanks to Titania's intervention this
    attempt never came to fruition, though in return she lost her life. Immediately
    after, Leore exploded with rage, angrily swinging his sword until all the flowers
    floating around him were soaked red with blood.
  summonDesc: I can't forgive a world in <br>which the good are trampled.<br>That
    is why I fight!
  fusionDesc: Life is more fleeting than<br>a flower in the wind.<br>Still, it is
    important to fight!
  evoDesc: There are some who will<br>never receive my mercy!<br>I'll chop them all
    up!
  element: 3
  rarity: 5
